# Line-ending and diff policy.
#
# Why this is not cosmetic: two merge-blocking gates compare file BYTES, not content.
#   - tokens:check regenerates packages/tokens/dist/* and crates/termai-tokens/src/lib.rs
#     and fails on drift (DC-09 idempotency), and ci.yml runs git diff --exit-code on them.
#   - the design gates hash the inline token block of prototype/termai-ui-terminal-first.html.
# A CRLF-converting checkout (core.autocrlf=true on Windows) would make those gates fail on
# files nobody edited. Normalise everything to LF in the repository.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending translated or diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.tmalog binary

# Generated-but-committed artifacts: keep diffs reviewable.
packages/tokens/dist/** -diff
crates/termai-tokens/src/lib.rs -diff
